# The Dockerfile only ever COPYs pyproject.toml/uv.lock/.python-version/src/
# (deploy/compose/docker-compose.yml's `embedding-sidecar` service builds
# this whole directory as its context) - everything below is real local
# state `docker build` would otherwise tar up and send to the daemon on
# every rebuild for nothing, including a multi-GB `.venv` (torch/
# sentence-transformers) once this project has been synced locally once.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
